<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has intensified drone attacks on civilian sites, striking a market in Abyei, a mourners gathering, a fuel market and a disputed territory market, causing hundreds of deaths. The Rapid Support Forces also use drones against economic targets such as gold-mining areas in West Kordofan and near the Egypt border, resulting in dozens of civilian fatalities. These operations extend drone use from combatant targets to markets, mourners, fuel supplies and contested zones, increasing civilian exposure to aerial strikes. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/sudan-drone-strike-kills-around-150-in-abyei-market/a-79716587?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/19/us-migrants-deportation-ukraine-sudan&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFBRbG15Z0YyVUdYbVBvVExSU3pPNUJqcXFYOHB3M0Z5XzBENVZ0bjFySmg4X1BMRW9GQ1ZoMFhBNmlrSHA5MGJOR2FSWkJ0eURVdGR2X21zZVlhMU5vRTNpal96TUtpeWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZHdPdHJvbUlsMVFnY29MWXpHZHZJQjN6dXRoVW5vVmp0Qng5ZjItd25wZ014Y29EMGFOWDY1b1JWdV9lRTcyS21leHVzNUQ3aTRDMU5wLTlqUXhoYXRuTkNjZUVVTjF1dFYyMzNLM0tieU9VNWhVUzJILTdWT3MzQ3VUc3Y5cGkxVjhpN3hXcGZielpTU0xITVo4eVpnRUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1wczhTM2FMeGJjMDRDbnROVkI0YVFUQmhlOWRyOFBGOXdPbFpLdlo2LWVqLUZERFF2blFrMVIwMkVuTG9Ca2Zmb2dRUGhQUmdxSWhfUzBQbE9GUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5VX1lhSFZQZFBVbktTOFlOc